[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Sensational News!]
[00:00.98]Lesson 133 | 第133课
[00:03.36]Sensational news! | 轰动新闻！
[00:05.88]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.08]What reasons did Karen Marsh give for wanting to retire? | 凯伦·马什给出哪些理由想要退休？
[00:19.62]Have you just made a new film, Miss Marsh? | 马什小姐，您刚拍了一部新电影吗？
[00:24.92]Yes, I have. | 是的，我拍了。
[00:27.86]Are you going to make another? | 您还要再拍一部吗？
[00:30.60]No, I'm not. | 不，我不拍了。
[00:32.66]I'm going to retire. | 我要退休了。
[00:35.64]I feel very tired. | 我觉得很累。
[00:38.72]I don't want to make another film for a long time. | 我很长时间都不想再拍电影了。
[00:45.57]Let's buy a newspaper, Liz. | 丽兹，我们买份报纸吧。
[00:49.84]Listen to this! | 听听这个！
[00:52.41]'Karen Marsh: Sensational News! | “凯伦·马什：轰动新闻！
[00:57.23]By our reporter, Alan Jones. | 记者：艾伦·琼斯。
[01:01.65]Karen Marsh arrived at London Airport today. | 凯伦·马什今天抵达伦敦机场。
[01:07.41]She was wearing a blue dress and a mink coat. | 她穿着一件蓝色连衣裙和一件貂皮大衣。
[01:13.49]She told me she had just made a new film. | 她告诉我她刚拍了一部新电影。
[01:19.02]she said she was not going to make another. | 她说她不会再拍了。
[01:25.16]She said she was going to retire. | 她说她要退休了。
[01:30.09]She told reporters she felt very tired and didn't want to make another film for a long time.' | 她告诉记者她感到非常疲倦，并且很长时间都不想再拍电影了。”
[01:41.56]I wonder why! | 我想知道为什么！